WEBVTT

01:36.509 --> 01:39.990
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.110 --> 01:41.970
[Episode 34]

01:56.759 --> 01:57.560
Mr. Xie.

02:01.430 --> 02:02.150
Well,

02:02.950 --> 02:04.590
w-we saw what happened next

02:05.840 --> 02:07.930
on the news.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.900
The accident was not all your fault.

02:11.450 --> 02:12.750
Tianming is gone,

02:13.000 --> 02:14.680
leaving us orphaned and widowed.

02:14.680 --> 02:16.600
I really had no choice.

02:17.160 --> 02:19.160
but to contact the media.

02:20.280 --> 02:23.829
I never thought it would make you lose your job

02:24.050 --> 02:25.960
and get a barrage of criticism.

02:26.810 --> 02:27.660
Forget about it.

02:29.300 --> 02:31.800
Take care of yourselves from now on.

02:32.390 --> 02:34.190
If you run into any difficulties, feel free to come to me.

02:34.360 --> 02:35.520
I'll do my best to help you.

02:36.760 --> 02:37.790
Well...

02:38.060 --> 02:40.070
Bee has sent someone to meet us,

02:40.170 --> 02:42.829
saying they'd help us pay off the mortgage.

02:43.280 --> 02:44.690
So please take this card back.

02:44.800 --> 02:47.430
No... That's what they should do.

02:47.720 --> 02:48.900
I wanted to make amends.

02:49.570 --> 02:50.720
Just keep it.

02:50.960 --> 02:53.130
You'll need it for the children's future education.

02:53.820 --> 02:56.400
Who committed the crime should pay the price.

02:56.840 --> 02:59.690
I can't bear to take your card.

03:04.670 --> 03:06.260
Fenghua has left.

03:06.620 --> 03:08.180
We have to move too.

03:08.520 --> 03:10.310
Do you know why she left?

03:10.860 --> 03:12.410
Wasn't she just doing well?

03:12.860 --> 03:15.640
You'll have to ask her about that.

03:16.620 --> 03:18.760
She handed over her work

03:19.079 --> 03:20.560
and satisfied everyone.

03:21.070 --> 03:22.470
But she didn't

03:22.660 --> 03:24.240
say a word about her feelings.

03:24.370 --> 03:27.010
Honestly, we all felt quite frustrated.

03:27.410 --> 03:28.510
After the meeting,

03:29.400 --> 03:30.840
she left right away even before we

03:30.870 --> 03:32.000
said goodbye properly.

03:32.810 --> 03:34.930
We're still

03:35.000 --> 03:36.360
reeling from it now.

03:42.130 --> 03:43.420
There's one more thing.

03:44.360 --> 03:45.710
P-Please don't get mad at me

03:46.100 --> 03:47.970
after you hear it.

03:48.630 --> 03:49.470
Go ahead.

03:52.970 --> 03:55.640
Fenghua probably sold the parcel delivery station

03:56.520 --> 03:57.910
because of me.

04:00.440 --> 04:01.470
Why?

04:02.700 --> 04:04.640
Someone once came to meet me.

04:04.960 --> 04:07.440
They wanted me to mess with Bee

04:07.540 --> 04:09.190
and ruin their reputation.

04:09.440 --> 04:11.140
They also gave me 300,000 yuan.

04:11.850 --> 04:13.600
After Fenghua found it out,

04:13.630 --> 04:15.900
she asked me to return it, but I refused.

04:15.930 --> 04:18.660
Then she gave me 300,000 yuan herself

04:18.690 --> 04:20.790
and told me to keep it secret from everyone.

04:21.180 --> 04:23.770
Not until she sold the parcel delivery station

04:23.800 --> 04:27.260
did I realize that she was running out of money.

04:27.880 --> 04:29.720
I'm sorry, Mr. Xie.

05:29.350 --> 05:30.360
Tumor?

05:34.510 --> 05:35.659
I guess

05:37.610 --> 05:38.780
she's been sick for quite a while

05:39.760 --> 05:41.470
and arranging the affairs before death.

05:42.300 --> 05:43.770
She even transferred her parcel delivery station.

05:48.810 --> 05:50.850
I knew she was feeling under the weather.

05:52.080 --> 05:54.690
She told me it was anemia, and I believed her.

05:56.340 --> 05:58.150
How could I be so dumb?

06:02.600 --> 06:03.600
Well...

06:03.630 --> 06:04.710
Should we go back too?

06:09.040 --> 06:10.310
I need to

06:11.050 --> 06:13.140
finish He's funeral arrangements first.

06:13.970 --> 06:16.290
I gotta ensure they receive the compensation.

06:16.330 --> 06:17.340
Otherwise,

06:18.190 --> 06:19.510
Fenghua would also be worried.

06:24.680 --> 06:25.890
Then I'll go back first.

06:25.920 --> 06:27.570
Anyway, I also feel pretty exhausted lately,

06:27.590 --> 06:29.030
not in the mood for job hunting.

06:29.060 --> 06:30.570
You wanted to go back

06:31.040 --> 06:32.409
a long time ago, didn't you?

06:42.570 --> 06:44.320
All of you

06:44.590 --> 06:45.840
are deserters,

06:46.510 --> 06:48.190
leaving me here alone.

06:55.390 --> 06:56.460
Aren't you tired?

06:59.380 --> 07:00.130
Yes, I am.

07:01.800 --> 07:03.110
I'm dead tired.

07:04.020 --> 07:05.640
But I don't want to lose.

07:06.860 --> 07:08.220
We should get back up

07:09.030 --> 07:10.910
from wherever we fell.

07:15.760 --> 07:16.760
Fine.

07:18.080 --> 07:19.680
Take your time getting back up.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.410
I'm out of this.

07:26.480 --> 07:27.990
Let's not tell anyone

07:28.010 --> 07:29.960
about Fenghua's situation for now.

07:30.740 --> 07:32.540
Go back and check on her condition.

07:32.570 --> 07:33.920
If it's not good,

07:33.940 --> 07:35.220
I'll head back immediately.

07:35.409 --> 07:37.940
I'll force her to come to Beijing for treatment no matter what.

08:03.430 --> 08:04.720
Have you decided what to do?

08:09.570 --> 08:10.250
Not yet.

08:11.000 --> 08:12.920
You plan to keep idling about, right?

08:15.360 --> 08:16.430
Please don't worry,

08:17.870 --> 08:18.680
I can't stay at home for long.

08:18.680 --> 08:19.600
Or I'll suffocate.

08:19.940 --> 08:21.380
Why don't you learn a trade?

08:25.070 --> 08:26.190
Learn what?

08:27.220 --> 08:28.100
Carpentry

08:28.720 --> 08:29.720
or tailoring, anything will do.

08:29.740 --> 08:31.140
Just have a skill to rely on

08:31.750 --> 08:32.870
and live off, at least.

08:33.580 --> 08:36.460
It's better than just messing around in society, right?

08:39.880 --> 08:41.429
I can go work as a construction laborer.

08:42.039 --> 08:44.230
You don't have the strength for that.

08:44.630 --> 08:46.200
You could learn to be a mason.

08:47.710 --> 08:49.710
It's said skilled ones can earn quite a bit in a day.

08:50.630 --> 08:51.940
Or you could ask Wanghe's father

08:52.200 --> 08:54.120
to teach you how to drive. That works too.

08:55.080 --> 08:56.010
I'm full.

08:56.320 --> 08:57.320
Enjoy your meal.

09:12.160 --> 09:13.270
You're full too?

09:30.790 --> 09:31.320
Take care.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.490
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou.

09:33.010 --> 09:34.460
Your dishes taste so good.

09:34.700 --> 09:35.460
Xingchi.

09:34.730 --> 09:38.400
[By the Canal]

09:36.790 --> 09:37.470
Mr. Zhou.

09:37.490 --> 09:38.180
Have you eaten yet?

09:39.550 --> 09:40.120
Yep.

09:44.780 --> 09:46.320
Want some plain noodles.

09:47.270 --> 09:48.240
Come on.

09:58.890 --> 09:59.550
Here you are.

10:01.540 --> 10:02.320
Be careful, it's hot.

10:02.320 --> 10:03.000
It's okay. I got this.

10:09.680 --> 10:10.760
No hurry.

10:10.790 --> 10:11.760
It's hot.

10:14.980 --> 10:17.180
I often cooked for myself in Beijing too.

10:18.490 --> 10:22.180
But the noodles I made were nowhere near as good as yours.

10:22.300 --> 10:23.600
I always felt

10:23.740 --> 10:24.920
there was a difference.

10:25.880 --> 10:28.030
Of course there was a difference!

10:28.460 --> 10:29.550
Listen.

10:29.570 --> 10:31.330
These noodles may look plain,

10:31.350 --> 10:33.420
but it's all about the details, you know?

10:33.450 --> 10:34.880
How to make the lard,

10:35.030 --> 10:36.150
how to cook the broth,

10:36.180 --> 10:37.530
how to fry the shrimp roe,

10:37.550 --> 10:40.420
and also what brand and what type of soy sauce to use,

10:40.450 --> 10:41.580
there are knacks for them.

10:42.220 --> 10:42.980
What knacks?

10:43.640 --> 10:45.050
Do you think I can tell you?

10:45.770 --> 10:48.340
It's a secret, a secret recipe. Understand?

10:48.800 --> 10:50.490
I haven't even told Haikuo.

10:51.290 --> 10:53.230
Haikuo doesn't even like plain noodles.

10:53.600 --> 10:54.910
There were several times in Beijing

10:54.960 --> 10:56.080
when we said we wanted to eat Huaiyang cuisine.

10:56.490 --> 10:58.130
Haikuo refused, saying he was so over it.

11:01.600 --> 11:03.440
Actually, we all felt

11:04.600 --> 11:05.650
homesick

11:05.680 --> 11:06.730
in Beijing,

11:07.520 --> 11:10.030
but Haikuo didn't seem to feel the same

11:11.930 --> 11:12.880
except for that one time.

11:14.080 --> 11:15.180
At that time,

11:15.300 --> 11:17.470
Haikuo was mistreated at work.

11:17.500 --> 11:18.420
He drank all night...

11:19.040 --> 11:20.990
I want to go home!

11:21.020 --> 11:21.610
Be careful...

11:21.670 --> 11:22.350
Don't fall.

11:22.390 --> 11:23.670
I want to go home!

11:23.670 --> 11:25.260
Go home... We're just going home now.

11:25.320 --> 11:27.790
I'm gonna swim back to the Flower Street!

11:27.790 --> 11:28.150
It's dangerous!

11:28.200 --> 11:29.080
Are you crazy?

11:29.080 --> 11:30.200
Come down...

11:30.270 --> 11:31.030
It's a deep river!

11:31.330 --> 11:32.550
Don't mess around!

11:33.440 --> 11:34.440
Are you nuts?

11:34.440 --> 11:36.200
In Beijing,

11:36.220 --> 11:38.100
I'm just like grass.

11:38.830 --> 11:40.070
Go home!

11:40.090 --> 11:41.810
I'm going back to my father.

11:42.330 --> 11:45.910
Even if I fail, he still treats me like a treasure.

11:45.960 --> 11:47.150
Who compared you to grass?

11:47.170 --> 11:48.520
I'll go fight him.

11:50.430 --> 11:51.560
I'm hungry.

11:51.910 --> 11:54.400
I want to eat the plain noodles my dad makes.

11:57.860 --> 11:58.800
I'm useless.

11:59.910 --> 12:01.600
I couldn't hold out in Beijing anymore,

12:01.670 --> 12:02.790
so I ran back home first.

12:04.610 --> 12:06.450
But I think Haikuo will also come back one day.

12:08.810 --> 12:09.570
Why?

12:11.900 --> 12:13.900
Wanghe is like a shark.

12:14.100 --> 12:16.150
He thrives in big cities.

12:16.490 --> 12:18.370
Haikuo and I are like freshwater fish.

12:19.010 --> 12:21.420
Only on the Flower Street, by the canal,

12:21.450 --> 12:22.690
do we feel like ourselves.

12:25.950 --> 12:26.910
Enjoy the noodles.

12:32.900 --> 12:34.260
I think

12:34.280 --> 12:35.630
you should feel lucky.

12:37.730 --> 12:38.850
Lucky about what?

12:38.880 --> 12:40.490
For such a materialistic girl,

12:40.870 --> 12:43.810
breaking up early is much better than getting married and then divorcing.

12:47.550 --> 12:50.150
The last time she came to meet me,

12:50.170 --> 12:51.860
I just didn't like her.

12:51.890 --> 12:55.010
But you were still in a relationship,

12:55.060 --> 12:56.750
so I didn't feel it was my place to say it.

12:56.810 --> 12:58.170
You're my mother.

12:58.980 --> 12:59.860
My real mother.

13:00.970 --> 13:03.770
You didn't even tell me when you thought I had chosen the wrong girlfriend.

13:06.090 --> 13:09.090
Whether two people are suitable for each other can only be told by themselves.

13:09.110 --> 13:11.300
Other people's opinions don't matter that much.

13:13.480 --> 13:14.480
So,

13:15.930 --> 13:17.530
when you find someone suitable again,

13:18.170 --> 13:20.520
you won't ask for my opinion either, right?

13:23.510 --> 13:24.800
What do you mean?

13:26.900 --> 13:28.230
After all these years,

13:29.720 --> 13:31.690
h-haven't you found someone suitable?

13:35.610 --> 13:37.380
Dad has never dated anyone.

13:39.080 --> 13:40.150
When others tried to set him up,

13:40.550 --> 13:42.120
he refused to meet anyone.

13:42.790 --> 13:43.790
So what?

13:44.550 --> 13:45.670
Your dad is more devoted than me.

13:45.670 --> 13:47.840
Should I give him an award or something?

13:49.550 --> 13:51.670
I know you're feeling down because of your breakup.

13:51.690 --> 13:54.450
I understand, but don't take it out on me.

13:54.480 --> 13:56.330
That's not what adults should do.

13:59.890 --> 14:02.370
Though Xiaohui said it was because of the house

14:03.020 --> 14:04.370
that she broke up with me,

14:04.660 --> 14:05.900
I feel like

14:06.910 --> 14:08.320
it's not just about the house.

14:10.440 --> 14:11.720
Are you trying to say

14:12.440 --> 14:14.480
that because of your dad and me,

14:14.910 --> 14:16.670
you have been traumatized

14:16.670 --> 14:17.440
and therefore

14:17.840 --> 14:19.840
can't start an intimate relationship?

14:20.560 --> 14:21.560
Is that it?

14:21.580 --> 14:22.460
What do you think?

14:26.440 --> 14:27.440
I admit

14:28.790 --> 14:30.440
that you're feeling unhappy now

14:30.790 --> 14:32.320
partly because of your dad and me.

14:33.030 --> 14:34.320
But who says

14:35.090 --> 14:37.780
people must live in perfect harmony?

14:37.810 --> 14:39.640
Can't there be other choices?

14:39.770 --> 14:41.060
And who says

14:41.090 --> 14:43.490
women can only stay at home to support their husbands, raise children,

14:43.510 --> 14:45.630
and stick to old clichés

14:45.660 --> 14:47.660
for their whole lives?

14:52.800 --> 14:53.670
I feel bad for you,

14:54.850 --> 14:57.010
and I understand what you've been through.

14:59.080 --> 14:59.980
However,

15:00.440 --> 15:02.030
I'm so sorry.

15:02.080 --> 15:03.080
Because I have never

15:03.080 --> 15:04.790
regretted my choices.

15:05.110 --> 15:07.940
In fact, I'm even proud of myself.

15:08.930 --> 15:12.690
I sincerely hope you can be like me,

15:12.710 --> 15:14.470
not caring about anyone's opinions

15:14.500 --> 15:16.300
and living for yourself bravely.

15:18.770 --> 15:21.220
One day when you understand what I just said,

15:22.030 --> 15:24.960
I believe you'll applaud yourself.

15:27.930 --> 15:28.740
Mom,

15:31.440 --> 15:33.430
I'm not as mature as you think.

15:35.150 --> 15:37.150
All these years, you've been chasing your dreams,

15:39.120 --> 15:41.120
and we could only support you.

15:41.730 --> 15:43.780
But have you ever considered our feelings?

15:45.550 --> 15:47.390
Actually, I'm quite envious of others.

15:48.810 --> 15:49.780
In our neighborhood,

15:51.200 --> 15:53.380
other families all live in harmony,

15:55.080 --> 15:56.150
But our family

15:57.370 --> 15:58.840
has always been missing one member.

15:59.970 --> 16:02.140
I don't even dare to mention you to Wanghe and others

16:03.090 --> 16:04.200
because I'm afraid

16:05.860 --> 16:08.740
it'll occur to them

16:09.450 --> 16:10.450
that I have a mom.

16:13.570 --> 16:17.540
You've never told me any of this before.

16:19.270 --> 16:20.200
Why didn't you tell me?

16:20.200 --> 16:21.200
You're my mom.

16:24.040 --> 16:25.210
I should

16:25.790 --> 16:28.660
do my best to fulfill my duty as a son,

16:29.530 --> 16:32.180
trying not to cause you any trouble or stress you out.

16:33.690 --> 16:34.740
But Mom,

16:37.440 --> 16:38.730
I also hope

16:39.750 --> 16:42.020
you can fulfill your duty as a mother,

16:45.650 --> 16:47.570
and, like other moms,

16:48.850 --> 16:51.320
remember that you have a son now and then.

16:54.630 --> 16:58.510
But it seems like

16:58.630 --> 17:01.140
you barely remember the existence

17:01.920 --> 17:03.800
of the person named Zhou Haikuo.

17:05.060 --> 17:06.410
It's just that I'm too busy.

17:06.440 --> 17:07.569
All these years on set,

17:07.589 --> 17:10.310
I've been too swamped even without time to sleep properly.

17:10.339 --> 17:11.470
Y-You know that.

17:11.500 --> 17:13.390
How long does it take you to reply to a WeChat message?

17:18.400 --> 17:19.550
I know you're busy,

17:22.440 --> 17:24.480
too busy to say thank you after receiving the flowers

17:26.770 --> 17:29.010
I sent you on Mother's Day.

17:30.420 --> 17:31.420
My dad,

17:32.090 --> 17:33.370
he's a man of few words

17:34.550 --> 17:36.400
who barely says anything nice.

17:36.790 --> 17:38.550
But when he knew I had a fever in Beijing,

17:40.200 --> 17:42.550
he came here overnight without hesitation

17:43.550 --> 17:45.480
and didn't leave until my fever broke.

17:46.810 --> 17:47.530
Mom,

17:52.440 --> 17:53.790
I came to meet you

17:55.070 --> 17:56.590
after breaking up with my girlfriend

17:59.790 --> 18:01.790
not for some lecture.

18:06.550 --> 18:08.510
Even if you don't say a word,

18:11.810 --> 18:13.090
a hug from you

18:17.580 --> 18:18.510
would be enough.

18:21.360 --> 18:22.530
You know what?

18:23.850 --> 18:25.370
All I need now

18:27.710 --> 18:29.300
is just a mom.

19:00.210 --> 19:04.940
[By the Canal]

19:03.290 --> 19:04.640
Mr. Shao.

19:07.940 --> 19:09.550
What's with that face?

19:09.580 --> 19:10.810
Haven't you seen a beautiful woman before?

19:15.050 --> 19:16.050
Where are the two of them?

19:17.770 --> 19:18.970
In Beijing.

19:19.300 --> 19:21.310
I came back alone this time.

19:23.780 --> 19:24.590
So, you will...

19:24.640 --> 19:25.440
I will not leave again.

19:25.920 --> 19:27.250
Really?

19:28.430 --> 19:30.380
Can't I also be a deserter

19:30.400 --> 19:31.270
like you?

19:31.300 --> 19:32.870
Yes, you can!

19:33.360 --> 19:34.620
Welcome home!

19:34.960 --> 19:35.830
Let me help you with that.

20:01.830 --> 20:03.210
It's so good to be back.

20:03.700 --> 20:06.420
I can smell the familiar aroma of food every day again.

20:08.400 --> 20:09.880
Did you tell Wanghe about your return?

20:12.860 --> 20:13.770
Nope.

20:14.130 --> 20:16.240
If I told him, he definitely wouldn't let me return.

20:16.400 --> 20:17.840
I snuck back myself.

20:25.230 --> 20:27.000
That incident of his is over now, right?

20:29.390 --> 20:30.830
He did lose his job.

20:31.610 --> 20:32.940
But he can rest for a while.

20:33.850 --> 20:35.290
Given his amazing capabilities,

20:35.320 --> 20:36.560
as long as he keeps his spirits up,

20:36.580 --> 20:38.450
he can make a comeback anytime.

20:38.480 --> 20:39.960
The company made him a scapegoat in public.

20:40.000 --> 20:41.510
I'm just worried about his mental state.

20:41.530 --> 20:42.950
He'll be fine.

20:43.070 --> 20:44.720
That guy is really tough.

20:45.660 --> 20:46.740
I believe

20:47.250 --> 20:49.810
no setback in this world can take him down.

20:49.840 --> 20:50.920
He's been faking it.

20:50.940 --> 20:52.830
If I get into trouble like this, I'll surely break down.

20:54.500 --> 20:56.000
He can't sit idle.

20:56.820 --> 20:59.420
What about you? Have you decided what to do?

21:02.560 --> 21:03.320
Not yet.

21:05.790 --> 21:06.780
Why not come work with me?

21:07.460 --> 21:10.090
That would be a shame! No way.

21:10.120 --> 21:12.770
What do you mean? Are you discriminating against women?

21:12.800 --> 21:14.520
How am I any worse than Wanghe?

21:15.120 --> 21:17.120
I'm just reluctant to work for you.

21:17.290 --> 21:20.880
It would turn our relationship into a boss-employee one.

21:28.570 --> 21:29.670
I'm hungry.

21:30.590 --> 21:31.630
Make me something to eat.

21:32.730 --> 21:33.810
What would you like to eat?

21:34.620 --> 21:37.060
Eel noodles, braised shredded tofu,

21:37.110 --> 21:39.380
lion's head meatballs, sweet and sour spare ribs.

21:39.970 --> 21:40.760
Okay.

21:41.150 --> 21:43.340
I'll make you all these dishes. But I'll hit you if you can't finish them.

22:09.420 --> 22:10.490
How about

22:10.980 --> 22:12.420
we go to Beijing?

22:13.330 --> 22:14.370
Why?

22:17.200 --> 22:18.860
Our son's in such big trouble.

22:19.700 --> 22:21.410
I'm afraid he can't pull through.

22:24.390 --> 22:25.560
Well,

22:26.690 --> 22:28.310
if he really did that,

22:28.350 --> 22:29.840
he deserves to be sacked.

22:31.030 --> 22:32.570
If he's been wrongly accused,

22:34.100 --> 22:36.350
it's good to leave that kind of company anyway.

22:38.180 --> 22:41.490
I'm just worried about our son's feelings.

22:44.630 --> 22:46.160
Everyone will suffer

22:46.640 --> 22:47.720
more or less in life.

22:49.430 --> 22:52.290
Taking a fall like this at his age is actually a blessing.

22:52.660 --> 22:54.360
He's still got the strength to get back up.

22:54.680 --> 22:56.400
Anyway, I have confidence in our son.

22:56.420 --> 22:57.180
Alright...

22:57.720 --> 22:59.110
Stop overthinking it. It's time to sleep.

23:06.200 --> 23:07.400
Look at this Xie's face.

23:07.400 --> 23:08.990
You can tell he's not a good guy at first glance.

23:09.040 --> 23:10.480
I dug into Xie's info.

23:10.480 --> 23:12.030
Seems like he's been in jail before.

23:13.840 --> 23:16.070
He's obviously been made a scapegoat.

23:16.070 --> 23:17.070
You don't believe this?

23:17.070 --> 23:18.400
Bee Group paid a high price

23:18.400 --> 23:20.200
to get Xie to take the blame.

23:20.220 --> 23:22.460
How could someone like this become an executive at Bee Group?

23:22.490 --> 23:23.820
He'll end up back in jail sooner or later.

23:23.880 --> 23:25.880
People like him will do anything for money.

23:26.290 --> 23:27.980
As a delivery rider, seeing this kind of news,

23:28.010 --> 23:29.590
I can't help but feel scared.

23:29.590 --> 23:30.640
Yet here I am,

23:30.640 --> 23:31.990
still on the way to deliver.

23:55.330 --> 23:56.910
The victim is gone.

23:56.930 --> 23:59.680
To prevent such tragedies from happening again,

23:59.710 --> 24:01.190
I, on behalf of myself,

24:01.210 --> 24:02.860
hereby make the following proposals

24:02.890 --> 24:04.750
to online food delivery platforms

24:04.780 --> 24:07.010
represented by Bee for their future planning

24:07.030 --> 24:08.470
and development.

24:08.500 --> 24:10.420
First, optimize the system

24:10.750 --> 24:12.610
to allow for flexible time.

24:12.640 --> 24:14.160
In cases of bad weather,

24:14.180 --> 24:16.220
accidents, or other special circumstances,

24:16.350 --> 24:17.900
delivery riders can get special treatment

24:18.040 --> 24:20.650
with their ratings and incomes not being affected.

24:20.970 --> 24:23.530
Second, ensure safety.

24:23.560 --> 24:26.470
For office buildings, hospitals, and other places with difficult access

24:26.490 --> 24:27.960
and navigation issues,

24:28.160 --> 24:30.460
try to set up smart food pickup lockers.

24:30.530 --> 24:32.510
Third, provide humanitarian care.

24:32.530 --> 24:35.150
Offer insurance and medical assistance to delivery riders,

24:35.170 --> 24:37.400
and when necessary, provide educational support

24:37.480 --> 24:38.790
for their family members.

24:38.890 --> 24:40.610
Last but not least, I hope

24:40.640 --> 24:42.630
Bee and all food delivery companies

24:42.650 --> 24:44.300
can take this incident

24:44.330 --> 24:46.050
as a serious lesson

24:46.070 --> 24:47.920
and not repeat the same mistakes

24:47.950 --> 24:49.470
in pursuit of excessive profits.

24:51.210 --> 24:52.770
[Stop acting like a good person. Were it not for you, he wouldn't be dead.]

24:52.770 --> 24:53.770
[He's using tricks to clear his name.]

24:53.800 --> 24:56.420
[I think it's another case of malicious marketing.]

24:56.420 --> 24:58.920
[Why can't we listen to his advice calmly?]

24:58.940 --> 25:00.620
[Stop acting like a good person. Were it not for you, he wouldn't be dead.]

25:00.620 --> 25:03.640
[Venting your anger here won't fix anything. I think Xie Wanghe is right.]

25:03.640 --> 25:07.020
[Especially the proposal for smart food pickup lockers. That's great. No more worries about lost food deliveries.]

25:07.050 --> 25:09.580
[So what if we think it's good? They're unaware of it.]

25:09.580 --> 25:12.840
[@Bee Delivery, @Eat Well, @Yuntu]

25:12.840 --> 25:14.620
[Take notes, guys!]

25:14.620 --> 25:17.640
[Here's your chance. Don't miss it.]

25:17.660 --> 25:20.840
[Everybody, @ them!]

25:20.860 --> 25:23.360
[I can't live without food delivery riders.]

25:23.370 --> 25:25.890
[I just gave a bottle of water to a delivery rider.]

25:25.920 --> 25:28.020
[Positive energy!]

25:30.400 --> 25:31.100
[Bee Delivery Initiated a Proposal to Online Food Delivery Platforms]

25:31.450 --> 25:33.520
[Repost]

25:40.460 --> 25:41.860
[I'm waiting for food delivery right now. No rush.]

25:42.110 --> 25:43.220
[Delivery riders need better insurance coverage.]

25:43.240 --> 25:44.550
[Yes, fewer tricks, more care.]

25:45.050 --> 25:46.200
[Humans don't have to make things difficult for humans. What if your family member is a delivery rider?]

25:46.560 --> 25:47.900
[My dad got laid off and became a food delivery rider. He's working really hard.]

25:50.390 --> 25:53.490
[I've been late for 3 orders today. I'm so exhausted.]

25:51.170 --> 25:53.490
[Be careful on the way. Cheer up.]

25:52.170 --> 25:53.490
[Get some rest. Take care.]

25:56.540 --> 25:58.450
[Bee Delivery Initiated a Proposal to Online Food Delivery Platforms]

25:58.710 --> 25:59.770
[Bee Delivery Initiated a Proposal to Online Food Delivery Platforms]

25:59.840 --> 26:02.120
[Xie Wanghe]

26:26.700 --> 26:27.500
Mr. Meng.

26:30.310 --> 26:32.930
Your PR approach this time is worth learning from.

26:33.960 --> 26:35.440
The more open you are to criticism,

26:35.870 --> 26:37.510
the more you can win people over.

26:38.650 --> 26:39.620
I hope

26:40.930 --> 26:42.980
such incidents won't happen again in the future.

26:43.820 --> 26:45.020
No way.

26:46.250 --> 26:47.970
Traffic accidents are unavoidable.

26:48.200 --> 26:51.110
No one knows when an accident will occur.

26:53.160 --> 26:54.800
Then we must stay on our toes.

26:55.030 --> 26:57.790
Before the next accident happens,

26:58.310 --> 26:59.990
we need to consider all possibilities

27:00.380 --> 27:02.120
and prepare relevant contingency plans.

27:13.320 --> 27:14.450
Well written.

27:15.480 --> 27:17.510
In the past few days, our legal department and law firm

27:17.530 --> 27:18.820
have also been working on a set of plans,

27:18.850 --> 27:21.450
regulating official compensation

27:21.480 --> 27:22.680
and pension payments,

27:23.260 --> 27:24.170
Moreover,

27:24.680 --> 27:26.470
there will be a training program.

27:27.240 --> 27:29.680
All delivery riders, before they officially hit the road,

27:29.680 --> 27:31.920
must pass a traffic safety test.

27:31.960 --> 27:33.510
Otherwise, they won't be assigned orders.

27:35.200 --> 27:36.790
Setting rules alone is not enough.

27:37.560 --> 27:38.990
You also need your people

27:39.010 --> 27:40.010
to implement them strictly.

27:55.090 --> 27:56.180
Let me do it.

27:56.550 --> 27:57.380
No, thanks.

28:05.770 --> 28:07.330
Are you sure these items

28:07.360 --> 28:09.030
are all your personal belongings?

28:09.670 --> 28:10.480
You're leaving the company.

28:10.890 --> 28:12.740
Company property cannot be taken away.

28:14.790 --> 28:16.180
Do you want to check?

28:16.210 --> 28:17.340
That's compulsory.

28:26.680 --> 28:28.070
Qiu Lin,

28:28.440 --> 28:29.480
don't go too far.

28:29.960 --> 28:31.720
Mr. Xie used to be a leader after all.

28:35.290 --> 28:37.790
Xie Wanghe, the Best Service Star.

28:39.920 --> 28:40.690
Alright,

28:41.460 --> 28:42.740
you can get lost now.

28:46.960 --> 28:47.680
Mr. Song,

28:48.830 --> 28:50.310
thank you for your hard work this time.

28:52.200 --> 28:52.960
It's my duty.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.790
As a veteran of the company,

28:58.580 --> 29:00.110
it was my job and duty

29:00.140 --> 29:01.700
to clean up the company

29:02.050 --> 29:04.030
and kick out a troublemaker like you

29:04.050 --> 29:05.740
in person.

29:09.000 --> 29:09.790
You two,

29:11.170 --> 29:12.450
take care.

29:13.080 --> 29:13.880
We will.

29:16.580 --> 29:17.730
What are you looking at?

29:18.400 --> 29:19.770
Didn't we get through this?

29:26.680 --> 29:27.550
Bro,

29:28.030 --> 29:29.100
are you really

29:29.130 --> 29:30.420
just letting him go like this?

29:30.750 --> 29:31.790
Yep.

29:32.750 --> 29:34.030
If you don't kill the snake when you strike,

29:34.050 --> 29:35.320
you'll surely suffer from it later.

29:35.880 --> 29:37.670
If he continues to work in this industry,

29:40.450 --> 29:41.820
I'll never

29:41.850 --> 29:43.160
feel at ease.

29:48.000 --> 29:49.930
Do you know where his weak spot is?

30:08.480 --> 30:09.240
Hello, Mr. Xie.

30:10.820 --> 30:11.860
I'm Jiang Ping from Yuntu.

30:15.340 --> 30:15.830
Hello.

30:15.860 --> 30:16.540
Hello.

30:16.680 --> 30:17.080
Please have a sit.

30:17.110 --> 30:17.640
Thanks.

30:22.440 --> 30:23.590
This is my business card.

30:29.570 --> 30:30.720
Sorry,

30:31.330 --> 30:33.330
I know you haven't been in a good mood lately.

30:33.360 --> 30:34.270
I once planned

30:34.290 --> 30:35.850
to reach out after a while,

30:35.880 --> 30:37.600
yet I was worried that other companies

30:37.620 --> 30:39.690
might approach you and give you an offer first.

30:41.310 --> 30:42.510
Given what happened to me,

30:42.540 --> 30:44.170
who would be so crazy to give me an offer?

30:46.440 --> 30:47.880
Others may not know,

30:48.050 --> 30:49.810
but we've been keeping a close eye

30:49.830 --> 30:51.290
on your every move at Bee.

30:51.810 --> 30:52.810
In Haidian,

30:52.840 --> 30:54.470
in such a short time

30:54.500 --> 30:56.260
and under such adverse conditions,

30:56.280 --> 30:58.520
you've been crushing our Yuntu in business.

30:59.330 --> 31:01.750
It's literally a business miracle.

31:01.770 --> 31:03.750
Let's skip the flattery

31:03.970 --> 31:04.780
and just get to the point.

31:04.990 --> 31:06.280
What do you want from me?

31:07.830 --> 31:09.070
Well, I'm here

31:09.810 --> 31:10.810
with you

31:10.840 --> 31:12.230
to sincerely invite you to join us.

31:14.910 --> 31:15.780
Actually,

31:15.810 --> 31:17.070
given your personality,

31:17.130 --> 31:18.770
you fit in way better with our Yuntu.

31:19.110 --> 31:19.720
Why?

31:20.590 --> 31:22.150
A wolf travels a thousand miles for meat;

31:22.170 --> 31:23.570
a dog does the same for shit.

31:23.600 --> 31:24.640
You're a wolf.

31:24.660 --> 31:27.380
There's no need for you to lead a flock of dogs to eat leftovers, right?

31:28.710 --> 31:29.960
You're overpraising me.

31:30.570 --> 31:32.320
I'm just a defeated man.

31:35.330 --> 31:36.680
Honestly,

31:37.000 --> 31:39.150
everyone in this industry knows

31:39.240 --> 31:40.270
that this time,

31:40.290 --> 31:41.720
you're taking the fall for the company.

31:41.850 --> 31:42.810
But we didn't expect

31:42.840 --> 31:44.790
Meng to go this far,

31:44.980 --> 31:46.820
not even leaving you a way out.

31:47.370 --> 31:48.400
This kind of thing

31:48.430 --> 31:49.430
would never happen

31:49.450 --> 31:51.070
in our Yuntu.

31:51.100 --> 31:53.300
We value talents

31:53.640 --> 31:55.060
way more than

31:55.080 --> 31:56.040
you could imagine.

32:07.250 --> 32:08.290
Here are

32:08.230 --> 32:10.430
[Employment Contract]

32:08.320 --> 32:09.760
the terms we're offering you.

32:09.780 --> 32:10.650
Please take a look.

32:18.560 --> 32:20.280
[Payment] [Party B's annual salary is set at 1,500,000 yuan.]

32:18.870 --> 32:21.170
These terms are too tempting.

32:22.440 --> 32:24.200
I'm kind of in shock.

32:24.880 --> 32:26.270
You're worth it.

32:28.180 --> 32:29.680
See if you have any other questions.

32:32.360 --> 32:33.860
I just want to know

32:35.280 --> 32:37.410
who's the mole in Bee.

32:40.590 --> 32:41.770
Mole?

32:43.290 --> 32:44.520
What do you mean?

32:47.920 --> 32:49.450
Over the past six months,

32:50.230 --> 32:51.910
every time we launched a campaign,

32:52.020 --> 32:54.140
Yuntu always managed to find a way to fight it.

32:54.160 --> 32:56.090
There were several times

32:56.110 --> 32:57.320
when you launched

32:58.000 --> 32:59.890
countermeasures even before we made a move.

32:59.920 --> 33:01.410
Once or twice, fine.

33:01.450 --> 33:03.180
But every single time?

33:03.290 --> 33:04.830
That's unusual, right?

33:05.430 --> 33:07.110
Perhaps,

33:07.140 --> 33:09.440
great minds think alike.

33:12.040 --> 33:13.080
Fine.

33:14.270 --> 33:15.860
Hope I'm just being paranoid.

33:16.810 --> 33:19.580
But before I get to the bottom of this case,

33:19.610 --> 33:21.340
I won't join Yuntu.

33:21.650 --> 33:23.830
Otherwise, I'd become the mole,

33:24.290 --> 33:26.050
and it would be impossible to explain it.

33:30.860 --> 33:31.820
It's not that serious.

33:32.570 --> 33:34.570
There aren't so many moles!

33:37.200 --> 33:39.420
You've just watched too many Hong Kong movies, I guess.

33:40.480 --> 33:41.350
Mr. Jiang,

33:42.560 --> 33:44.520
I even suspect

33:44.540 --> 33:46.340
that my misfortune this time

33:46.370 --> 33:48.790
was just orchestrated by this mole.

33:53.320 --> 33:54.200
Take your time.

33:54.200 --> 33:55.430
I gotta go to attend to something.

33:56.050 --> 33:57.020
Take care, Mr. Jiang.

33:58.470 --> 33:59.540
Check, please.

34:17.000 --> 34:17.800
Come in.

34:21.710 --> 34:23.360
Mr. Meng, Mr. Song is here.

34:24.440 --> 34:25.230
Welcome.

34:28.440 --> 34:28.960
Have a seat.

34:36.960 --> 34:38.710
We've finally managed to get through this.

34:38.710 --> 34:39.920
Next time,

34:39.960 --> 34:42.670
don't let those youngsters mess around again.

34:44.440 --> 34:46.920
We all know what was going on with Wanghe.

34:48.110 --> 34:48.920
To be honest,

34:49.670 --> 34:51.510
it also brought me great pain

34:51.920 --> 34:53.190
to sacrifice him this time.

34:56.440 --> 34:57.840
Fortunately, he didn't make a fuss about it.

34:58.260 --> 34:59.490
Before leaving,

34:59.630 --> 35:01.610
[Business Strategy Plan]

34:59.960 --> 35:01.190
he wrote me a report.

35:01.960 --> 35:02.920
It includes

35:02.960 --> 35:05.280
strategic plans and marketing ideas for the next few years.

35:05.300 --> 35:07.130
Everything is clearly organized.

35:07.160 --> 35:08.520
If

35:08.540 --> 35:10.750
we strictly follow this plan,

35:11.960 --> 35:13.280
defeating Yuntu

35:13.300 --> 35:14.340
is just a matter of time.

35:15.730 --> 35:16.690
Have someone make copies of it.

35:16.720 --> 35:17.510
You gotta get the hang of it soon.

35:23.670 --> 35:24.320
Okay.

35:25.700 --> 35:26.620
Song,

35:28.190 --> 35:29.000
keep this a secret.

35:32.430 --> 35:33.150
Don't worry.

35:46.370 --> 35:48.990
[Chairman's Office]

35:57.150 --> 35:57.880
This way, please.

36:01.940 --> 36:02.670
Mr. Jiang.

36:03.460 --> 36:04.450
Mr. Jiang!

36:08.720 --> 36:09.590
It's fine.

36:09.630 --> 36:10.440
This is my brother-in-law.

36:10.440 --> 36:11.360
He's one of us.

36:11.790 --> 36:12.790
I'm Qiu Lin.

36:13.490 --> 36:14.010
Mr. Jiang,

36:14.070 --> 36:14.800
I've heard a lot about you.

36:14.820 --> 36:15.570
Hello.

36:15.760 --> 36:16.480
Have a seat, please.

36:16.510 --> 36:17.570
Please take the main seat.

36:20.200 --> 36:20.930
Let me help you.

36:20.960 --> 36:21.580
I put it here.

36:21.610 --> 36:22.190
Okay.

36:23.290 --> 36:24.850
Qiu Lin, pour the drinks.

36:25.590 --> 36:26.400
Don't send me

36:26.420 --> 36:28.420
WeChat messages and emails lately.

36:28.450 --> 36:29.710
And don't contact me again.

36:31.260 --> 36:32.100
Why?

36:33.960 --> 36:34.880
Today,

36:34.960 --> 36:36.140
I met Xie Wanghe.

36:36.170 --> 36:37.420
He said Meng Wei

36:37.960 --> 36:39.070
has already resorted

36:39.250 --> 36:40.550
to an economic investigation of the mole.

36:40.660 --> 36:41.880
Is that true?

36:43.080 --> 36:44.280
No way.

36:44.700 --> 36:46.420
If this was true,

36:46.790 --> 36:48.680
Meng would inform me in no time.

36:50.350 --> 36:51.670
If he's not telling you,

36:51.880 --> 36:54.100
it means he's already starting to suspect you.

36:55.810 --> 36:57.390
You need to do a quick check yourself.

36:57.810 --> 36:58.830
Clear out

36:58.960 --> 37:00.440
all those clues

37:00.820 --> 37:02.190
as soon as possible.

37:02.250 --> 37:03.590
Don't worry.

37:03.960 --> 37:05.120
I'll nail it.

37:05.480 --> 37:06.740
Besides,

37:06.760 --> 37:08.360
we only emailed each other.

37:08.560 --> 37:09.290
Oh, right.

37:09.540 --> 37:11.420
Have you deleted all the emails

37:11.480 --> 37:12.710
I sent you before?

37:12.730 --> 37:14.030
Of course.

37:14.050 --> 37:15.710
If there's any urgent matter,

37:15.730 --> 37:16.780
let's talk face to face.

37:16.800 --> 37:17.990
Remember,

37:18.010 --> 37:19.810
any electronic message

37:19.840 --> 37:21.520
will leave a trace.

37:23.220 --> 37:24.140
Understood.

37:25.810 --> 37:27.780
Then is the paper file okay?

37:38.580 --> 37:40.980
[Business Strategy Plan]

37:39.960 --> 37:41.150
This is Bee's

37:41.170 --> 37:42.570
future strategic plan.

37:42.960 --> 37:45.280
Meng attaches great importance to it.

37:49.650 --> 37:52.120
Mr. Jiang, please take a look in person.

38:03.440 --> 38:04.150
Mr. Jiang!

38:04.440 --> 38:05.400
Wish us

38:05.440 --> 38:06.550
a successful cooperation!

38:07.830 --> 38:08.370
Come on.

38:08.390 --> 38:09.000
Come on.

38:09.000 --> 38:09.760
Mr. Jiang,

38:13.040 --> 38:13.970
What are you doing?

38:14.260 --> 38:14.820
Who are you?

38:14.850 --> 38:15.610
What are you doing?

38:15.630 --> 38:16.660
Stop shooting!

38:16.690 --> 38:17.400
What are you doing?

38:17.400 --> 38:18.110
Stop shooting! Get out!

38:18.110 --> 38:18.760
Stop it!

38:20.960 --> 38:21.800
Meng?

38:24.270 --> 38:25.060
Don't move!

38:25.080 --> 38:25.670
Hey!

38:25.690 --> 38:27.220
Sit tight! Don't move.

38:27.250 --> 38:28.250
Stop shooting!

38:28.270 --> 38:29.310
Don't move!

38:29.340 --> 38:29.770
Stand straight.

38:29.800 --> 38:30.440
Well...

38:31.130 --> 38:32.490
What's this all about, Meng?

38:33.110 --> 38:34.310
What do you mean?

38:34.850 --> 38:37.040
In view of your veteran status, I tolerated your past greed

38:37.060 --> 38:38.770
and didn't take action against you.

38:39.790 --> 38:41.620
But given what you've done today...

38:42.380 --> 38:43.060
Spit it out.

38:43.090 --> 38:45.150
How can I explain this to the board?

38:45.620 --> 38:46.790
I said, stop shooting!

38:46.820 --> 38:48.200
Don't you understand?

38:48.230 --> 38:49.520
Stop it!

38:54.260 --> 38:56.110
Have you watched too many Hong Kong movies?

39:05.250 --> 39:06.690
You were right.

39:06.710 --> 39:08.710
As soon as Song heard about the strategic plan,

39:08.860 --> 39:10.650
he would take action.

39:10.900 --> 39:12.590
But I'm curious.

39:13.150 --> 39:14.000
How did you know

39:14.030 --> 39:16.780
Song would meet Jiang Ping there?

39:17.050 --> 39:18.710
To catch the mole,

39:19.130 --> 39:20.810
I bought a membership card at that restaurant.

39:21.790 --> 39:24.290
Directors and above only need to say their names.

39:24.320 --> 39:26.350
Song loves to take all the small advantages.

39:26.460 --> 39:27.460
He deserves this.

39:29.440 --> 39:31.010
Is this necessary?

39:31.400 --> 39:34.050
Executives' meals can be invoiced and reimbursed.

39:34.190 --> 39:36.360
Why do we have to stick to one specific restaurant?

39:36.380 --> 39:37.600
They offer a discount

39:37.700 --> 39:39.440
of 40% for bulk purchases.

39:39.470 --> 39:40.800
We can also bring our own drinks.

39:40.820 --> 39:42.660
More importantly, it's close to the company.

39:42.690 --> 39:43.920
We can sign the bills right after eating.

39:43.940 --> 39:45.620
It saves us the reimbursement process.

39:46.250 --> 39:47.460
What's the point?

39:47.480 --> 39:48.560
We need to simplify processes.

39:48.590 --> 39:50.540
Use our manpower only where it matters most.

39:50.570 --> 39:51.150
From now on,

39:51.150 --> 39:52.230
for small matters like this,

39:52.250 --> 39:53.440
you can decide on your own.

39:53.470 --> 39:54.800
No need to consult me.

39:58.890 --> 40:00.650
When you reported it back then,

40:00.720 --> 40:01.720
I thought

40:01.740 --> 40:03.470
you just wanted to get some benefits.

40:09.230 --> 40:10.360
If convicted,

40:11.800 --> 40:13.030
how long will Song be sentenced?

40:14.810 --> 40:17.410
Leaking trade secrets is a pretty sensitive issue.

40:18.000 --> 40:19.230
Once exposed,

40:19.710 --> 40:21.510
it's likely to result in lawsuits.

40:22.110 --> 40:24.540
The market value of both Bee and Yuntu will be affected.

40:26.000 --> 40:27.110
Before IPO,

40:28.030 --> 40:29.590
it's better to avoid unnecessary troubles.

40:31.210 --> 40:32.770
But we can't just let go of them, can we?

40:33.190 --> 40:34.190
Of course not.

40:34.220 --> 40:35.850
I've already had someone investigate it.

40:36.510 --> 40:38.110
Before you even came to Haidian,

40:38.440 --> 40:40.950
Song and Qiu Lin had taken advantage of their positions

40:41.030 --> 40:42.760
to embezzle company subsidies.

40:42.850 --> 40:44.330
They used proxy companies for the transactions.

40:45.110 --> 40:46.670
The lawyers have already collected evidence.

40:46.710 --> 40:47.320
Soon,

40:47.630 --> 40:49.400
they will be charged with embezzlement

40:50.080 --> 40:51.670
and tax evasion.

40:52.320 --> 40:53.480
This time, Song and Qiu Lin

40:53.480 --> 40:55.680
will end up behind bars for life.

40:56.880 --> 40:58.030
With the moles cleared out

40:58.710 --> 40:59.760
and this matter resolved,

41:00.880 --> 41:02.320
you should return to your post.

41:03.880 --> 41:04.880
Now in Jiangsu, Zhejiang, and Shanghai,

41:04.900 --> 41:06.650
we need a regional director.

41:08.150 --> 41:08.860
Hurry up.

41:08.890 --> 41:10.220
Go back and pack up.

41:10.240 --> 41:11.910
Go make your mark there.

41:16.180 --> 41:17.450
I want to take some time off.

41:18.110 --> 41:19.540
There's an urgent matter at home.

41:23.630 --> 41:24.510
How long do you need?

41:25.140 --> 41:26.100
I don't know.

41:31.000 --> 41:32.210
Not now.

41:33.040 --> 41:34.690
Our company is about to go public.

41:34.710 --> 41:35.500
You

41:35.530 --> 41:36.860
can't be distracted now.

41:37.230 --> 41:38.800
Otherwise, even if I save a position for you,

41:38.800 --> 41:39.880
others won't be convinced.

41:41.080 --> 41:42.210
If you leave now,

41:42.240 --> 41:44.150
all your previous efforts will be in vain.

41:44.440 --> 41:45.800
Without you,

41:45.820 --> 41:46.780
Bee wouldn't have made it this far.

41:48.920 --> 41:51.440
Just enjoy the fruits of victory.

42:59.960 --> 43:00.760
Haikuo.
